##listShove30##
// medium jam (~30%)
22 33 44 55 66 77 88 99 TT JJ QQ KK AA
A4s A5s A6s A7s A8s A9s ATs AJs AQs AKs
A8o A9o ATo AJo AQo AKo
K8s K9s KTs KJs KQs
KTo KJo KQo
Q9s QTs QJs
